#: includes/strings.php:50
msgid ""
"Authority Mailer helps you send WordPress emails reliably through "
"professional SMTP providers. No more emails landing in spam! This quick "
"setup wizard will guide you through connecting your preferred email service "
"in just a few minutes."
msgstr ""
"Authority Mailer le ayuda a enviar correos de WordPress de forma fiable a "
"través de proveedores SMTP profesionales. ¡Se acabaron los correos en spam! "
"Este asistente de configuración rápida le guiará en la conexión de su "
"servicio de correo preferido en solo unos minutos."

#: includes/strings.php:51
msgid "✨ What happens next?"
msgstr "✨ ¿Qué sucede a continuación?"

#: includes/strings.php:52
msgid ""
"<strong>Choose your email provider</strong> from our list of 17+ supported "
"services"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Elija su proveedor de correo</strong> de nuestra lista de más de 17 "
"servicios compatibles"

#: includes/strings.php:53
msgid "<strong>Enter your credentials</strong> (usually just an API key)"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Introduzca sus credenciales</strong> (normalmente solo una clave API)"

#: includes/strings.php:54
msgid "<strong>Send a test email</strong> to verify everything works"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Envíe un correo de prueba</strong> para verificar que todo funciona"

#: includes/strings.php:55
msgid ""
"<strong>You're done!</strong> All WordPress emails will now be sent reliably"
msgstr ""
"<strong>¡Listo!</strong> Todos los correos de WordPress se enviarán ahora de "
"forma fiable"

