#: includes/strings.php:205
msgid ""
"SendLayer is a simple and affordable SMTP provider focused on making "
"transactional email delivery straightforward for WordPress sites."
msgstr ""
"SendLayer es un proveedor SMTP simple y asequible centrado en hacer que la "
"entrega de correo transaccional sea sencilla para sitios WordPress."

#: includes/strings.php:206
msgid ""
"SMTP.com offers enterprise-grade SMTP relay, deliverability analytics and "
"scaling for transactional email."
msgstr ""
"SMTP.com ofrece retransmisión SMTP de nivel empresarial, análisis de "
"entregabilidad y escalado para correo transaccional."

#: includes/strings.php:207
msgid ""
"Brevo (formerly Sendinblue) provides email and SMS services for "
"transactional and marketing messages with an easy-to-use dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Brevo (anteriormente Sendinblue) proporciona servicios de correo y SMS para "
"mensajes transaccionales y de marketing con un panel fácil de usar."

#: includes/strings.php:208
msgid ""
"Elastic Email provides an API and SMTP relay suited for both transactional "
"and bulk messaging, with analytics and domain management."
msgstr ""
"Elastic Email proporciona una API y retransmisión SMTP adecuadas para "
"mensajería transaccional y masiva, con análisis y gestión de dominios."

#: includes/strings.php:209
msgid ""
"MailerSend is a developer-friendly transactional email API and SMTP relay — "
"great for notifications, receipts and transactional workflows."
msgstr ""
"MailerSend es una API de correo transaccional y retransmisión SMTP amigable "
"para desarrolladores — ideal para notificaciones, recibos y flujos de "
"trabajo transaccionales."

#: includes/strings.php:210
msgid ""
"Mailgun is an email API built for developers and teams. Use a verified "
"sending domain for best deliverability and analytics."
msgstr ""
"Mailgun es una API de correo creada para desarrolladores y equipos. Use un "
"dominio de envío verificado para mejor entregabilidad y análisis."

#: includes/strings.php:211
msgid ""
"Mailjet is an email API and SMTP relay platform that supports transactional "
"and marketing emails with templates and analytics."
msgstr ""
"Mailjet es una plataforma de API de correo y retransmisión SMTP que admite "
"correos transaccionales y de marketing con plantillas y análisis."

#: includes/strings.php:212
msgid ""
"Mandrill (Mailchimp Transactional) is a reliable transactional email API "
"designed for developers sending notifications and receipts."
msgstr ""
"Mandrill (Mailchimp Transactional) es una API de correo transaccional fiable "
"diseñada para desarrolladores que envían notificaciones y recibos."

#: includes/strings.php:213
msgid ""
"Postmark focuses on fast, reliable transactional email delivery and provides "
"a simple API and message streams for transactional use."
msgstr ""
"Postmark se centra en la entrega de correo transaccional rápida y fiable y "
"proporciona una API simple y flujos de mensajes para uso transaccional."

#: includes/strings.php:214
msgid ""
"SMTP2GO provides a simple REST API for sending transactional email and an "
"SMTP relay with global infrastructure for reliability."
msgstr ""
"SMTP2GO proporciona una API REST simple para enviar correo transaccional y "
"una retransmisión SMTP con infraestructura global para fiabilidad."

#: includes/strings.php:215
msgid ""
"SparkPost provides a powerful email API and SMTP relay with features for "
"deliverability and analytics."
msgstr ""
"SparkPost proporciona una potente API de correo y retransmisión SMTP con "
"funciones para entregabilidad y análisis."

#: includes/strings.php:216
msgid ""
"Zoho Mail is a secure email hosting service with SMTP support, ideal for "
"businesses using Zoho Suite or requiring reliable email delivery."
msgstr ""
"Zoho Mail es un servicio de alojamiento de correo seguro con soporte SMTP, "
"ideal para empresas que usan Zoho Suite o requieren entrega de correo fiable."

#: includes/strings.php:217
msgid ""
"Send emails using your Gmail account with OAuth authentication for enhanced "
"security."
msgstr ""
"Envíe correos usando su cuenta de Gmail con autenticación OAuth para mayor "
"seguridad."

#: includes/strings.php:218
msgid ""
"Leading email API platform with powerful features for transactional and "
"marketing emails."
msgstr ""
"Plataforma líder de API de correo con potentes funciones para correos "
"transaccionales y de marketing."

#: includes/strings.php:219
msgid ""
"Amazon SES is a scalable cloud-based email service by AWS. Use SMTP "
"credentials for reliable transactional email delivery with pay-as-you-go "
"pricing."
msgstr ""
"Amazon SES es un servicio de correo escalable basado en la nube de AWS. Use "
"credenciales SMTP para entrega de correo transaccional fiable con precios de "
"pago por uso."

#: includes/strings.php:220
msgid ""
"Office 365 provides enterprise email services through Microsoft Exchange "
"Online with SMTP relay support for WordPress integration."
msgstr ""
"Office 365 proporciona servicios de correo empresarial a través de Microsoft "
"Exchange Online con soporte de retransmisión SMTP para integración con "
"WordPress."

#: includes/strings.php:221
msgid ""
"Use a custom SMTP service by providing host, port and credentials. This "
"option works with most email providers and self-hosted SMTP servers."
msgstr ""
"Use un servicio SMTP personalizado proporcionando host, puerto y "
"credenciales. Esta opción funciona con la mayoría de proveedores de correo y "
"servidores SMTP autohospedados."

